{"id":157,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"Said to purify lost, forsaken souls with its flames and guide them to the afterlife. I believe its form has been influenced by the energy of the sacred mountain towering at Hisui's center."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Typhlosion obscures itself behind a shimmering heat haze that it creates using its intensely hot flames. This Pokémon creates blazing explosive blasts that burn everything to cinders."},{"games":["Y","SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"It has a secret, devastating move. It rubs its blazing fur together to cause huge explosions."},{"games":["X","HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"If its rage peaks, it becomes so hot that anything that touches it will instantly go up in flames."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It attacks using blasts of fire. It creates heat shimmers with intense fire to hide itself."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"It can hide behind a shimmering heat haze that it creates using its intense flames. TYPHLOSION create blazing explosive blasts that burn everything to cinders."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"When heat from its body causes the air around it to shimmer, this is a sign that it is ready to battle."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Blaze","hidden":false,"description":"Powers up Fire-type moves when the Pokémon's HP is low."},{"name":"Flash Fire","hidden":true,"description":"If hit by a Fire-type move, the Pokémon absorbs the flames and uses them to power up its own Fire-type moves."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":1,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"grassland","color":"Yellow","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":155,"name":"Cyndaquil","condition":null,"children":[{"id":156,"name":"Quilava","condition":"Lv. 14 or Lv. 17, in Hisui","children":[{"id":157,"name":"Typhlosion","condition":"Lv. 36 or Lv. 36, in Hisui","children":[]}]}]},"moves":